{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Better Mart \u2013 Build and Manage Your Dream Supermarket!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Better Mart</strong>, a dynamic management game, in 1st person, where you create, customize, and grow the <strong>ultimate supermarket</strong>! Combining <strong>fun and strategy</strong>, this game gives you complete freedom to design a <strong>unique store</strong>, attract customers, and maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/d00adbfae534fa0d5af95cdd6ea63844.avif?t=1761678026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras_big/d00adbfae534fa0d5af95cdd6ea63844.avif?t=1761678026 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Complete and Addictive Management Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Better Mart</strong>, you have full control over every aspect of your hypermarket. Choose the layout of your aisles, arrange products efficiently, and optimize customer flow to ensure a smooth and enjoyable shopping experience. Keep your shelves stocked, monitor market trends, and adjust your prices to outsmart the competition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in Better Mart:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Build and customize your supermarket</strong> \u2013 Design the aisles, set up different areas, and create a welcoming environment for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Manage supply and inventory</strong> \u2013 Keep track of stock levels, order new products, and adjust prices based on market trends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/b5fd92f9bebb121394b7dc62943b5377.poster.avif?t=1761678026\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/b5fd92f9bebb121394b7dc62943b5377.webm?t=1761678026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/b5fd92f9bebb121394b7dc62943b5377.mp4?t=1761678026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grow your business</strong> \u2013 Hire and train staff, improve checkout efficiency, and invest in modern equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unlock new sections</strong> \u2013 Add a bakery, fresh produce section, electronics department, and much more to expand your offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Enhance customer experience</strong> \u2013 Study customer behavior, optimize their shopping journey, and ensure their satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Expand your empire</strong> \u2013 Start with a small grocery store and transform it into a thriving supermarket chain while overcoming market challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/8367f7300c9dcbad7e511236374ef4be.poster.avif?t=1761678026\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/8367f7300c9dcbad7e511236374ef4be.webm?t=1761678026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/8367f7300c9dcbad7e511236374ef4be.mp4?t=1761678026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are You Ready for the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dream of building a retail empire and tackling the challenges of real entrepreneurship, <strong>Better Mart</strong> is the game for you. Manage your inventory, oversee your staff, optimize customer experience, and turn your store into a true success story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take charge and build the ultimate supermarket today!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/516284b154f664fc08de4178ddecf7a9.poster.avif?t=1761678026\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/516284b154f664fc08de4178ddecf7a9.webm?t=1761678026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/516284b154f664fc08de4178ddecf7a9.mp4?t=1761678026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Better Mart!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/14c6dd3a2197d92957d9494966929ebe8571bff6.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/41f65c7b1544cd57206e1c774638dd02517fa120.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/f06014bd6e692a75234e90a7a8cd978d574ad288.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/8a764ccf21db3e066d9e1ee667e174e986ad6f6a.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/33bb08c90f43255ca6043c56fba73afd688a9180.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/18ecf30318f30eca2d88